{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《中年好聲音4》昨晚（2日）晚播映「10強累積排名分」第三回合——「突破之夜」。參賽者周志康以一身黑色皮褸及戴墨鏡造型登場，演繹鄭秀文的經典金曲《獨家試唱》，帶動全場氣氛。 </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"d0443b61-5cf9-47ab-9a2e-a6c6a281.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Fpe7FKOt181785728133.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d0443b61-5cf9-47ab-9a2e-a6c6a281.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">周志康的型格造型獲得著名時裝設計師何國鉦頒發「最佳衣著獎」。主持車婉婉打趣指其眼神猛烈得「好似要吞咗肥媽咁」，肥媽亦形容志康勢如「猛龍」，笑言：「佢一除衫，我隔籬嗰個係咁叫！」評審亦給予高度評價，張佳添盛讚志康兼具實力與顏值，指他「型到爆」：「你絕對可以做到『實偶派』，實力偶像！」更笑言：「結咗婚嘅男人唔可以咁型嚟，你老婆會好冇安全感嚟。」「知音人」李思捷則指被他13秒的 Mic Stand 互動深深擊中：「好似睇緊鋼管舞，揮灑自如」，並笑建議他下次可嘗試雙截棍。 </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"edca5c56-ccb5-4384-b383-8818bdbd.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026TxWwZNIr8U1785728133.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"edca5c56-ccb5-4384-b383-8818bdbd.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"d292b177-0995-4404-8bc9-6a4c4511.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Idw0Mlmcqd1785728133.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d292b177-0995-4404-8bc9-6a4c4511.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">最終，周志康憑藉破格表現豪取 <strong>93 </strong>分，強勢奪得本場 MVP。他在獲獎後感性坦言自己原本不是一個喜歡突破的人：「多謝呢個主題，令我可以突破，感謝《中年》呢個舞台。追夢太困難，中間可能會好多個波折，但係唔緊要，你願意去行、去突破、去將自己最想做嘅嘢，一路去做，就得喇。」同時，周志康亦不忘感謝特地到場力撐的太太，公開甜喊：「佢係我屋企嘅<strong> MVP</strong>，佢係一個最好嘅太太，最好嘅媽媽。」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"c2638e50-dbb5-40d2-a800-abf9244f.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026O73KeFuPBf1785728132.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c2638e50-dbb5-40d2-a800-abf9244f.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T03:59:03.489545+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":512,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}